{"page":132,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:36","surah":6,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّمَا يَسْتَجِيبُ ٱلَّذِينَ يَسْمَعُونَ ۘ وَٱلْمَوْتَىٰ يَبْعَثُهُمُ ٱللَّهُ ثُمَّ إِلَيْهِ يُرْجَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Only those who can hear will respond; as for the dead, God will raise them up, and to Him they will all be returned.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْتَجِيبُ","en_gloss":"respond","transliteration":"yastajību","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَسْمَعُونَ ۘ","en_gloss":"listen","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","en_gloss":"But the dead ","transliteration":"wal-mawtā","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَبْعَثُهُمُ","en_gloss":"will resurrect them","transliteration":"yabʿathuhumu","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُرْجَعُونَ","en_gloss":"they will be returned","transliteration":"yur'jaʿūna","verse_key":"6:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٣٦","en_gloss":"(36)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:36"}]},{"verse_key":"6:37","surah":6,"ayah":37,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟ لَوْلَا نُزِّلَ عَلَيْهِ ءَايَةٌ مِّن رَّبِّهِۦ ۚ قُلْ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ قَادِرٌ عَلَىٰٓ أَن يُنَزِّلَ ءَايَةً وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They also say, ‘Why has no sign been sent down to him from his Lord?’ Say, ‘God certainly has the power to send down a sign,’ though most of them do not know:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"And they said","transliteration":"waqālū","verse_key":"6:37"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَوْلَا","en_gloss":"Why (is) not","transliteration":