{"pos":21,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"6:38"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يُحْشَرُونَ","en_gloss":"they will be gathered","transliteration":"yuḥ'sharūna","verse_key":"6:38"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:38"}]},{"verse_key":"6:39","surah":6,"ayah":39,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا صُمٌّ وَبُكْمٌ فِى ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ ۗ مَن يَشَإِ ٱللَّهُ يُضْلِلْهُ وَمَن يَشَأْ يَجْعَلْهُ عَلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who reject Our signs are deaf, dumb, and in total darkness. God leaves whoever He will to stray, and sets whoever He will on a straight path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"rejected","transliteration":"kadhabū","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Verses","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":4,"ar":"صُمٌّۭ","en_gloss":"(are) deaf","transliteration":"ṣummun","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَبُكْمٌۭ","en_gloss":"and dumb","transliteration":"wabuk'mun","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ ۗ","en_gloss":"the darkness[es]","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"Whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَشَإِ","en_gloss":"wills","transliteration":"yasha-i","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُضْلِلْهُ","en_gloss":"He lets him go astray","transliteration":"yuḍ'lil'hu","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"and whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَشَأْ","en_gloss":"He wills ","transliteration":"yasha","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَجْعَلْهُ","en_gloss":"He places him","transliteration":"yajʿalhu","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":16,"ar":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) straight","transliteration":"mus'taqīmin","verse_key":"6:39"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٣٩","en_gloss":"(39)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:39"}]},{"verse_key":"6:40","surah":6,"ayah":40,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ أَرَءَيْتَكُمْ إِنْ أَتَىٰكُمْ عَذَابُ ٱللَّهِ أَوْ أَتَتْكُمُ ٱلسَّاعَةُ أَغَيْرَ ٱللَّهِ تَدْعُونَ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘Think: if the punishment of God or the Hour should come to you, would you call on anyone other than God, if you are being truthful?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَكُمْ","en_gloss":"Have you seen","transliteration":"ara-aytakum","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَتَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"(there) came to you","transliteration":"atākum","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَذَابُ","en_gloss":"punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābu","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَتَتْكُمُ","en_gloss":"(there) came to you","transliteration":"atatkumu","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","en_gloss":"the Hour ","transliteration":"l-sāʿatu","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَغَيْرَ","en_gloss":"is it other","transliteration":"aghayra","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(than) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"you call","transliteration":"tadʿūna","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":15,"ar":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","en_gloss":"truthful","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","verse_key":"6:40"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٤٠","en_gloss":"(40)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:40"}]},{"verse_key":"6:41","surah":6,"ayah":41,"ar_uthmani":"بَلْ إِيَّاهُ تَدْعُونَ فَيَكْشِفُ مَا تَدْعُونَ إِلَيْهِ إِن شَآءَ وَتَنسَوْنَ مَا تُشْرِكُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"No indeed, it is on Him that you would call. If it were His will, He could remove whatever harm made you call on Him, and then you would forget what you now associate with Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِيَّاهُ","en_gloss":"Him Alone","transliteration":"iyyāhu","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"you call","transliteration":"tadʿūna","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَيَكْشِفُ","en_gloss":"and He would remove","transliteration":"fayakshifu","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"you call","transliteration":"tadʿūna","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"upon Him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَتَنسَوْنَ","en_gloss":"and you will forget","transliteration":"watansawna","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تُشْرِكُونَ","en_gloss":"you associate (with Him)","transliteration":"tush'rikūna","verse_key":"6:41"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٤١","en_gloss":"(41)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:41"}]},{"verse_key":"6:42","surah":6,"ayah":42,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ أَرْسَلْنَآ إِلَىٰٓ أُمَمٍ مِّن قَبْلِكَ فَأَخَذْنَـٰهُم بِٱلْبَأْسَآءِ وَٱلضَّرَّآءِ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَتَضَرَّعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent messengers before you [Prophet] to many communities and afflicted their people with suffering and hardships, so that they could learn humility.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَآ","en_gloss":"We sent (Messengers)","transliteration":"arsalnā","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُمَمٍۢ","en_gloss":"nations","transliteration":"umamin","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَأَخَذْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"then We seized them","transliteration":"fa-akhadhnāhum","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِٱلْبَأْسَآءِ","en_gloss":"with adversity","transliteration":"bil-basāi","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلضَّرَّآءِ","en_gloss":"and hardship","transliteration":"wal-ḍarāi","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"so that they may","transliteration":"laʿallahum","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَتَضَرَّعُونَ","en_gloss":"humble themselves","transliteration":"yataḍarraʿūna","verse_key":"6:42"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤٢","en_gloss":"(42)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:42"}]},{"verse_key":"6:43","surah":6,"ayah":43,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَوْلَآ إِذْ جَآءَهُم بَأْسُنَا تَضَرَّعُوا۟ وَلَـٰكِن قَسَتْ قُلُوبُهُمْ وَزَيَّنَ لَهُمُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ مَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If only they had learned humility when suffering came from Us! But no, their hearts became hard and Satan made their foul deeds alluring to them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَوْلَآ","en_gloss":"Then why not","transliteration":"falawlā","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَآءَهُم","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāahum","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَأْسُنَا","en_gloss":"Our punishment","transliteration":"basunā","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَضَرَّعُوا۟","en_gloss":"they humbled themselves","transliteration":"taḍarraʿū","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَسَتْ","en_gloss":"became hardened","transliteration":"qasat","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُلُوبُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَزَيَّنَ","en_gloss":"and made fair-seeming","transliteration":"wazayyana","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the Shaitaan","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they used to","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"6:43"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٤٣","en_gloss":"(43)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:43"}]},{"verse_key":"6:44","surah":6,"ayah":44,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا نَسُوا۟ مَا ذُكِّرُوا۟ بِهِۦ فَتَحْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ أَبْوَٰبَ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا فَرِحُوا۟ بِمَآ أُوتُوٓا۟ أَخَذْنَـٰهُم بَغْتَةً فَإِذَا هُم مُّبْلِسُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So, when they had forgotten the warning they had received, We opened the gates to everything for them. Then, as they revelled in what they had been given, We struck them suddenly and they were dumbfounded.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"So when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَسُوا۟","en_gloss":"they forgot","transliteration":"nasū","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ذُكِّرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were reminded","transliteration":"dhukkirū","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of [it]","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَتَحْنَا","en_gloss":"We opened","transliteration":"fataḥnā","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"on them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَبْوَٰبَ","en_gloss":"gates","transliteration":"abwāba","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"(of) every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":10,"ar":"شَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَرِحُوا۟","en_gloss":"they rejoiced","transliteration":"fariḥū","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أُوتُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they were given","transliteration":"ūtū","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَخَذْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"We seized them","transliteration":"akhadhnāhum","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بَغْتَةًۭ","en_gloss":"suddenly","transliteration":"baghtatan","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"and then","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":19,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مُّبْلِسُونَ","en_gloss":"(were) dumbfounded","transliteration":"mub'lisūna","verse_key":"6:44"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٤٤","en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:44"}]}]}